content-warning-message =
    Space Station 14 is a deep-space disaster simulator, featuring fictional characters having complex relationships and experiencing life threatening situations.

    Do not make a stand in for yourself. If you are not confident in your ability to distinguish what is part of the game and what isn't, do not play.

    Characters may have familial, vindictive, or romantic relationships, precipitated by the actors behind them.
    At the same time, understand that not everyone might be comfortable with participating in this kind of play if you want to participate yourself.

    Do not play if you are sensitive to:
    - Character & animal death
    - Gore & body horror
    - Violent crime & terrorism
    - Brainwashing & loss of autonomy
